        "step1": {
          "title": "Piecing it Together w/ Pooya Parsa",
          "duration": "4:44:45",
          "channel": "Ryan Carniato",
          "description": "This week we look at the UnJS project, an ecosystem of open source libraries building the foundations of the web. Pooya, core maintainer, joins us to talk about libraries like Nitro, H3, Unstorage, and how they all go together to build a framework agnostic future.\n\n[0:00] Preamble\n[8:30] Welcome Pooya Parsa & History of Unjs\n[19:00] Nuxt 2 & The Birth of Nitro\n[28:30] Nuxt vs. Nuxtlabs vs. Unjs\n[33:00] jiti & Balancing Multiple Projects\n[38:30] h3 & radix3: Composable Server Primitives\n[49:30] Q & A - http2 streaming & proxied dev server\n[53:30] unplugin: Unified Bundler Plugins\n[58:45] unenv & std-env: Cross-Platform Compatibility\n[1:06:00] Magicast, Unhead, and untyped\n[1:13:45] Unstorage - Async K/V Anywhere\n[1:24:00] Cookies & Sessions\n[1:29:00] unbuild, Consola, listhen, unimport\n[1:35:00] ofetch & Node 16 reaching End-of-Life\n[1:41:30] c12 - Smart Configuration Loading\n[1:48:00] Nitro - Routing & Caching Overview\n[1:58:00] Nitro - StackBlitz Example\n[2:08:00] Nitro - Handlers & Params\n[2:19:15] Nitro - Middleware, Mountpoints, and Storage Layer\n[2:25:15] Nitro - Typesafe Routes & Streaming Responses\n[2:36:00] Nitro - Early Hints\n[2:43:00] Q & A - Nextjs app dir? What's next?\n[2:49:00] Viteconf\n[2:56:00] Vinxi & Saying Goodbye to Pooya\n[3:02:00] Update - What About Bling!?\n[3:10:00] Update - What About Astro!?\n[3:17:30] Update - Balance of Control in Meta-Frameworks\n[3:31:30] TWiJ - Solid News\n[3:35:30] TWiJ - Astro 3.0 & Islands vs. Remix vs. RSC\n[3:47:00] TWiJ - Million.js & React Forget\n[3:58:30] TWiJ - DHH & TypeScript (technical difficulties)\n[4:10:30] TWiJ - DHH & TypeScript Take 2\n[4:22:15] TWiJ - PartyKit Expands Team\n[4:26:00] TWiJ - Bun Hits 1.0\n[4:32:00] TWiJ - Vite & Next.js\n[4:39:00] Conclusion\n\nThank you to @zombiefacesupreme for the timestamps.",
